# spec: the 700's ANC on/off is the enabled byte of CNC [1.5] ([steps, step, enabled]); set_anc off reads the current step and writes [step, 0], keeping the step.
# source: hardware report on firmware 1.8.2-11524+e0f7590: GET [1.5] = 0b0001, SETGET [1.5] 00 00 returned 0b0000, and the Bose app then showed noise cancelling off.
device nc700
call set_anc off
send 01 05 01 00
recv 01 05 03 03 0b 00 01
send 01 05 02 02 00 00
recv 01 05 03 03 0b 00 00
result ok
